The system response \( R_S(t) \) is:  
\[
R_S(t) = R_1(t) \cdot R_2(t) \cdot \ldots \cdot R_n(t) = (1 - f_1(t)) \cdot (1 - f_2(t)) \cdot \cdots \cdot (1 - f_n(t))
\]  

