   Substitute \( v_A = \frac{m_B}{m_A} v_B \):
   \[m_A \left(\frac{m_B}{m_A} v_B\right) + m_B v_B = m_A v_B' + m_B v_A'\]
   \[v_B + m_B v_B = m_A v_B' + m_B v_A'\]
   \[v_B (1 + m_B) = m_A v_B' + m_B v_A'\]

